HYPOTHESIS H6  [paradigm: P3_hayek]  (seq 7)
======================================================================
CLAIM      : Decentralisation and null-discrimination are COMPLEMENTS, not substitutes: local repair handles what the centre cannot see, BLIND handles what local organs cannot know is systemic.
PREDICTION : H_local_blind beats BOTH H_local and C_blind_symbol.
FALSIFIER  : FALSIFIED if H_local_blind fails to reduce undetected_ticks by at least 5% vs H_local -- i.e. if adding BLIND on top of local repair buys nothing, they are substitutes and the complementarity claim is wrong.
